sk/component query."]},{"id":"UDI-DAT-004","kind":"rule","title":"Keep row actions attached to a recognizable record","category":"tables-data-visualization","guidance":["Include a stable row identifier and accessible action names that provide context when repeated.","Group infrequent actions in a labeled menu and keep destructive actions distinct from routine navigation."],"ruleIds":[],"sourceIds":["SRC-UDI-ORIGINAL"],"score":0.013333333333333334,"reasons":["User task/component query."]},{"id":"PAT-RESPONSIVE-TABLE","kind":"pattern","title":"Responsive data table","category":"tables-data-visualization","guidance":["Keep semantic headers and row identity intact.","Use a labeled horizontal scroll region or a task-focused stacked row layout.","Prioritize essential columns and retain access to secondary values."],"ruleIds":["UDI-DAT-001","UDI-DAT-004","UDI-RSP-004"],"sourceIds":["SRC-UDI-ORIGINAL"],"score":0.03252247488101534,"reasons":["Coverage query: responsive.","User task/component query."]},{"id":"UDI-ANT-002","kind":"rule","title":"Do not use vague errors that blame the user","category":"anti-patterns","guidance":["Name the field, explain the unmet requirement, and show an acceptable example when format matters.","Keep the value the user entered unless clearing it is necessary for safety."],"ruleIds":[],"sourceIds":["SRC-UDI-ORIGINAL"],"score":0,"reasons":["Required reference of UDI-ANTI-002."]},{"id":"UDI-ANTI-002","kind":"anti-pattern","title":"Generic or blame-oriented validation","category":"anti-patterns","guidance":["Users must guess which input failed.","The same value may be repeatedly submitted without a useful correction path.","Explain the requirement beside the field and identify the affected value.","Preserve valid input and provide a clear route to retry."],"ruleIds":["UDI-ANT-002","UDI-FOR-002","UDI-FOR-004"],"sourceIds":["SRC-UDI-ORIGINAL"],"score":0.01639344262295082,"reasons":["User task/component query."]},{"id":"PAT-VALIDATED-FORM","kind":"pat